<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεκ-πλέω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεκ-πλώω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έπλωσα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sail out through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἑλλήσποντον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.147
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Κυανέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.89
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν διώρυχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.122
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοίνους δυώδεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρακλέων στηλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.42
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>sail out,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in naval
			tactics, <i>break the enemy's line by sailing through it,</i> so
			as to be able to charge their ships in flank or rear, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.36
			</span></i>, Sosyl.<i><span class="en">
				p.31
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.51.9
			</span></i>.</div>
